Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.21,0:00:00.63,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,1066)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你要...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.64,0:00:01.52,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,1066)\fscx120\fscy120}你要离开我了吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.52,0:00:02.29,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,1066)\fscx120\fscy120}对不起……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.29,0:00:03.70,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,1066)\fscx120\fscy120}但我们不能在一起……！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.04,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,1066)\fscx120\fscy120}虽然我是那么想和你在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.05,0:00:05.83,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}为什么，Miku!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.83,0:00:07.49,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}就因为我不是Vocaloid吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.50,0:00:09.17,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不，原因比那深刻得多……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.72,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,880)\fscx120\fscy120}是因为你是红头发！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:13.58,miku,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,820)\fscx120\fscy120}我父母绝不会同意我和一个红头发的人在一起的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:14.50,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1078)}{\b1}{\fscx120\fscy120}**你父母的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.51,0:00:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1586,218)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她说道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.26,0:00:16.98,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,820)\fscx120\fscy120}他们从来就没关心过你的幸福！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.83,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,1066)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}没有我你也会过得很好，Teto…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.85,0:00:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1603,240)}{\b1}Miku转过身去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1642,353)}{\b1}不忍心看到Teto\N如此痛苦的样子…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.22,0:00:22.10,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,1066)\fscx120\fscy120}不，我不会好的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.11,0:00:23.62,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,1066)\fscx120\fscy120}没有你我活不下去，Miku！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:26.04,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}认识你，就像吃了一辈子普通面包后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:27.78,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}第一次尝到新鲜法棍面包的滋味
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.79,0:00:30.27,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1062)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我回不去没有你的生活了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.42,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,800)\fscx120\fscy120}我怎么能当作什么都没发生过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:34.27,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1}{\pos(961,800)\fscx120\fscy120}我已经尝到了你那如黄油般甜蜜的爱!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:35.87,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1477,861)}{\b1\fscx150\fscy150}Teto，我-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:35.87,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1492,858)\frz18}{\b1\fscx150\fscy150}听好了，笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:36.34,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1513,826)}{\b1\fscx200\fscy200}我……！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Teto犹豫了一下，但还是脱口而出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:39.87,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1058)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我喜欢你啊，行了吧!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.55,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,800)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我…我明白如果你没有那种感觉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:42.51,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1069)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}但是求你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:43.18,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你不能……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.19,0:00:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1065)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她突然感觉自己被拉入了一个温暖的怀抱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,812)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她抬起头，迎上的是Miku近在咫尺的脸庞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.89,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1062)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}初音几乎是用耳语般的声音说道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.43,0:00:52.15,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1059)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Teto……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.38,0:00:53.47,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1061)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我也爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1058)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Teto睁大了眼睛，满脸通红
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.17,0:00:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,809)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她本来就已经快绷不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1058)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}初音的话更是让她彻底崩溃！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:00.48,teto,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你… 你这-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1058)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}初音把一根手指轻轻按在Teto的唇上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:02.73,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,1075)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}嘘……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:04.20,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,1067)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你什么都不用说……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,814)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她把手移开，轻轻贴在Teto的脸颊上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,832)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}另一只手则环住了这只奇美拉的腰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,832)}{\b1}两人双唇之间的距离一分一秒地缩短
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.27,0:01:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,821)}{\b1}每一秒都让Teto对初音的渴望愈发强烈！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}一颗流星在她们身后划过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.72,0:01:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}恰好在此刻坠落，为她们献上一个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}浪漫的、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.95,0:01:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}充满激情的、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.58,0:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}热烈的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}亲亲亲亲——
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:21.01,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,1067)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}诶，这什么情况？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:21.44,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}啊啊啊啊啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.45,0:01:22.70,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}没什么，还给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.71,0:01:24.75,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx110\fscy110}Teto的钻头双马尾在风中飘动，Miku看得目瞪口呆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.77,0:01:26.28,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你居然在写同人文???
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:26.87,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}哈哈哈哈哈哈！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:27.53,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我没有！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:28.38,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}这文里的黄段子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:28.73,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}啊啊啊啊啊——！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.73,0:01:29.46,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}根本就没有！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.47,0:01:30.28,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}别念了！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:32.14,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,803)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}哇 Flower，你这写的也太变态了吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:34.54,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,790)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你觉得从你嘴里说出来这话有分量吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.56,0:01:36.18,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}也许没有，但还是扎心了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.19,0:01:37.32,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}FUKASE 还给我！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:39.46,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}再说了，这文写得完全不对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.48,0:01:42.65,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你不仅是个同人文写手，而且水平还很烂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:44.84,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,784)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你懂什么写作啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.86,0:01:48.32,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,784)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}这是一个关于两个女人陷入深深悲剧爱情的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.82,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,784)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她们必须在家人和彼此之间做出选择
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.83,0:01:52.35,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}很深奥、很发人深省！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:53.73,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}好尬……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.79,0:01:55.23,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,782)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}告诉你，我有30多个读者呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.24,0:01:58.33,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}显然他们除了少女自设文之外什么都没读过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:02:00.22,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,768)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不是自设文！是Miku和Teto!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.25,0:02:01.44,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}来，我给你写个更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(381,330)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}那是个寒冷的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.37,0:02:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(589,496)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}重音Teto终于攒够钱换了个稍微\N大点的纸箱住，但还是不太舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(560,370)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她闭上眼睛，祈求一死了之…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:11.63,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}这什么鬼！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:13.52,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,775)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}耐心点，这叫铺垫场景
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(860,341)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}突然，重音Teto听到一辆布加迪的引擎声由远及近
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.31,0:02:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她朝路边望去，看到Miku从车里走下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.57,0:02:20.21,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1357,620)}{\b1\fscx200\fscy200}喂……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.08,0:02:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,773)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Miku边说边朝Teto撒钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:24.01,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,810)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我还从来没见过哪个合成音源有这么诱人的双钻头马尾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.36,0:02:25.05,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(350,405)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}想上来坐坐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:26.05,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}天哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.07,0:02:26.59,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}嘿嘿嘿~！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Teto心花怒放，跳了上去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}然后Miku把她带到了自己的豪宅，两人在沙发上亲热了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.13,0:02:31.84,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:32.80,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}烂透了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.82,0:02:34.77,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,789)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}才没有，你根本就不懂Miku！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.16,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她那么有钱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.16,0:02:37.85,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1076)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你觉得她会浪费时间搞什么浪漫？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:40.59,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不，Flower说得对，你写的那玩意儿品味太差了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:38.82,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1381,205)\frz26}{\b1\fscx250\fscy250}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.54,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,728)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你从哪儿冒出来的!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.54,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}看到了吧!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:43.22,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不过Flower写的也挺烂的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:44.54,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,684)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你该不会一直都在吧…？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:44.19,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.55,0:02:46.53,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx110\fscy110}来，我让你们看看什么叫真正的写故事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:49.56,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}从前，重音Teto去Miku家送花给她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:50.87,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Miku超级开心！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:53.43,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}然后Miku带Teto出去约会，他们吃了意大利面
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:54.74,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}两个人都超喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.63,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}然后她们买了情侣装，接着结了婚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:02:59.40,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}还生了两个孩子，叫Mito和Teku
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:00.83,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}从此他们幸福地生活在了一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:01.27,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}完！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.29,0:03:02.31,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}虐点在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:02.31,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,754)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}烂死了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:02.65,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:05.09,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你们两个就知道把她们塞进各种奇葩剧情里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.23,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我觉得我的故事很美
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:06.99,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我的碾压全场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:08.51,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}才没有！我的最有深度！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:09.96,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不，我的最好，你怎么就看不出来！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.17,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}好了好了，大家冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.20,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}虽然很明显我的文才是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.21,0:03:14.75,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我们让Piko来评评，行吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.77,0:03:16.57,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}让他选自己最喜欢哪篇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:17.50,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:17.51,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.08,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}嘿 Pikoooooo！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:20.33,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(961,784)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Piko，我们在写Mikuto同人文！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:22.56,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx110\fscy110}Piko，我、Flower和Oliver在写Teto×Miku的同人文
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.56,0:03:24.51,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你能不能告诉我们你最喜欢哪——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:28.97,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}呃，嘿、嘿各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:30.58,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}这、这位是初音小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:33.73,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}她来是想友好地跟我们谈歌曲合作的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:34.55,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}呵……呵……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:38.99,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}里面根本没有黄段子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.53,0:03:38.99,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx150\fscy150}FUKASE!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:40.93,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}没关系，我想我该走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:42.54,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}Piko，我们改天再谈这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.55,0:03:44.45,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}初音小姐，非常抱歉，能不能请您-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:45.47,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不，够了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:47.29,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}有必要的话我会再联系你的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:48.17,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}再见
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.59,0:03:52.40,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}不过说真的……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:54.78,teto,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}反正我听说她新声库烂得要命……
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:57.35,灰,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,375)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}你知道你刚害我们损失了多少吗!?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:58.45,浅色,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}啊啊啊啊啊啊——！！！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.35,0:03:58.45,黄,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,320)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}真是不幸啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:04.31,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}开车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1538,322)\frz22}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}没有引擎的声库算什么？\N没有爱的心脏算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.97,0:04:18.51,miku,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1080)}{\b1\fscx120\fscy120}我觉得还不错吧
